{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22230","headline":"截树 · 白居易","name":"截树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种树当前轩，树高柯叶繁。\n惜哉远山色，隐此蒙笼间。\n一朝持斧斤，手自截其端。\n万叶落头上，千峰来面前。\n忽似决云雾，豁达覩青天。\n又如所念人，久别一款颜。\n始有清风至，稍见飞鸟还。\n开怀东南望，目远心辽然。\n人各有偏好，物莫能两全。\n岂不爱柔条，不如见青山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}